# actions that call themselves to walk through lists inside lists
me can total_of thing
    if kind of thing is "number"
        give thing
    me has sum 0
    each part in thing
        sum gain me total_of part
    give sum

me can flatten thing
    me has out list
    each part in thing
        if kind of part is "list"
            out is out + (me flatten part)
        else
            out gain part
    give out

me can depth thing
    if kind of thing is not "list"
        give 0
    me has best 0
    each part in thing
        best is me biggest best (me depth part)
    give best + 1

me has tree list 1 (list 2 (list 3 4)) (list) 5
say me total_of tree
say me flatten tree
say me depth tree
